    "body": "I think since we want same-document navigations to do replacement as well, we probably should do this check before the fragment navigation check above. Maybe we should do something for history.pushState as well?\r\n\r\nAlso I just realized, same-URL navigations will probably never get to the check here because it's always gets into the fragment navigation check above (since it's the same URL). So maybe we need to move this anyways.",
